    "introduction": "Alliance Witan is a listed investment trust holding a portfolio of global equities. Its investment manager, WTW, allocates capital among specialist managers whose selections are combined into one portfolio, bringing together different investment styles and areas of expertise. Shareholders gain exposure to the underlying companies through shares in the trust rather than owning each holding directly. Returns reflect portfolio gains and losses, dividend income, fees and any borrowing costs. The trust's own share price can differ from the value of its investments. Its distinguishing feature is the multi-manager structure, which aims to diversify stock selection while maintaining a coordinated approach to the overall portfolio.",
